BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Comedians with Disabilities Act at Curious Comedy Theater
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T213000
UID:260513itvZKv3A9kyiPtbgWE5SMQ
DESCRIPTION:The Comedians with Disabilities Act brings its acclaimed comed
 y showcase to Curious Comedy Theater for a special one-night fundraiser su
 pporting the upcoming documentary Going Beyond the Punchlines.    Founded 
 in 2010 in Northern California\, the troupe highlights diverse comedic voi
 ces and perspectives from performers with disabilities. The evening featur
 es stand-up from co-headliners Loren Kraut and Nina G\, along with perform
 ances by Mean Dave\, Serena Gamboa\, and veteran comic Milt Abel.    Blend
 ing humor\, storytelling\, and advocacy\, the show celebrates comedy that 
 challenges perspectives while entertaining audiences of all abilities.
URL:https://www.winecountry.com/event/comedians-with-disabilities-act-at-c
 urious-comedy-theater/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
