DESCRIPTION:SUNSETS IS BACK! Come Paradise with us and join us for Wines &
  Sunsets. A Wednesday night concert series in Paradise -- featuring a rota
 ting schedule of LIVE music and local food vendors! We've got a great line
  up this year with some new and exciting acts and we can't wait to see you
