UID:260514KdDuhp7v70aWkTQss8vwQQ
DESCRIPTION:✨ THURSDAY NIGHT KARAOKE — SONOMA’S LONGEST-RUNNING LEGE
 ND ✨ Step into the heart of Sonoma this Thursday at the Sonoma Speakeasy
  for the karaoke night that started it all — the longest-running karaoke
  in downtown Sonoma. Every Thursday\, from 8:00 PM – Close\, the mic is 
 yours\, the stage is alive\, and the energy is unmatched. But the night st
 arts early — doors open at 4:00 PM\, and Happy Hour runs from 4:00 – 7
 :00 PM\, giving you plenty of time to grab your favorite drink\, settle in
 \, and get ready for an evening packed with music\, laughter\, and unforge
 ttable moments. Whether you’re belting your favorite ballad\, performing
  a high-energy hit\, or cheering on friends from the bar\, Thursday night 
 karaoke at the Speakeasy is about great people\, great drinks\, and even g
 reater memories. The room buzzes with excitement\, the cocktails are flowi
 ng\, and every performance is a story waiting to be told. ✨ Why Thursday
  at the Speakeasy is Unmissable: The longest-running karaoke night in down
 town Sonoma Happy Hour from 4–7 to kick off your night in style A lively
  crowd\, endless laughs\, and unforgettable energy Your chance to shine on
  stage or cheer on your friends Doors Open: 4:00 PM Karaoke: 8:00 PM – C
 lose Sonoma Speakeasy — Where Every Voice is Welcome Thursday nights are
 n’t just a night out — they’re an experience. Be there. Sing loud. M
 ake memories. \\#SonomaSpeakeasy \\#ThursdayKaraoke \\#DowntownSonoma \\#L
 ongestRunningKaraoke
LOCATION:Sonoma Speakeasy and American Music Hall
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/908632231982070/?acontext=%7B%22event_
 action_history%22%3A[%7B%22mechanism%22%3A%22lov_feed%22%2C%22surface%22%3
 A%22bookmark%22%7D]%2C%22ref_notif_type%22%3Anull%7D
