BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Friday Night Comedy - Terrell "Big T" Butler - Downtown
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260522T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260522T220000
UID:260404CNshbX6E5kG17j8Taf-jTg
DESCRIPTION:Friday night stand-up comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nVIP TAB
 LES NOW AVAILABLE! Snag a table for 4 with preferred seating\, your own pr
 ivate call button to summon service\, and your first round of drinks (or a
  bottle of wine) for only $95!\n\nEvery Friday night hilarious comedians f
 rom The Bay Area and beyond perform at Barrel Proof Lounge. Stick around a
 fter for late-night karaoke! Fresh lineup of funny each Friday.\n\nThis We
 ek: Jon Lehre (host) Jon Alcabes Headliner: Terrell 'Big T' Butler\n\nTerr
 ell Butler is originally from Oakland California. Affectionally referred t
 o by his nickname Big-T\, he has always been the comedian of his social ci
 rcle. Taking the stage for the first time in 2007 as a stand up comic\, he
  hit the ground running. He has quickly earned respect at the premier come
 dy clubs across Northern and Southern California as a feature performer.\n
 \nTerrell is a graduate of Academy Of Art University\, with a degree in Co
 m- munication and Media Technology. He has hosted several Live Stream TV S
 hows\, Produced two radio shows “The Bridge” & “The Rise N’ Grind 
 Show”. He also worked as the Program Director for Urban Knight Radio at 
 AAU.\n\nBig-T is the Winner of the 2016 Rooster T. Feathers Comedy Competi
 tion\, in Sunnyvale CA. As a stand up comedian\, Big-T draws his comedy fr
 om life ex- perience. Ranging from The colorful characters in his family\,
  his life as an Oak- land youth\, and his years as a bouncer in Bay Area n
 ightclubs & gentlemens clubs. Comedy has awakened a new spirit in the 6 fo
 ot 3\, 315 pound\, devilishly Handsome\, Big-T. Terrell credits his influe
 nce in stand up to legends like Eddie Murphy\, Richard Pryor\, and Robert 
 Townsand. A spirit that has inspired him to this day.\n\n21+ Doors - 7p / 
 Show - 8p $15adv / $20door\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** fo
 r all sorts of good times ahead.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/friday-night-comedy-terrell-big-t-butler-
 downtown-santa-rosa-tickets-1984347749536?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
