DESCRIPTION:🧑‍🌾Come to Garden Party and join Farmer Emily in maint
 aining our thriving edible garden!  \n\n🌿Through hands-on science and a
 rt activities\, you will learn more about sustainable gardening practices 
 you can use beyond our walls in your own home garden. \n\n🥗You could ev
