SUMMARY:The Social Contractors: Live & Free @ Lagunitas Tap Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T180000
UID:260519uuBrDmjVjk-uqj6KkCqZgQ
DESCRIPTION:“….Get ready for the super-entertaining sounds of local ba
 nd The Social Contractors. They totally rock\, in all the right ways…”
  - Argus-Courier\n\nJoin The Social Contractors from 3:30-6 PM on Saturday
 \, 5/23 as they return to Lagunitas Tap room for an afternoon and evening 
 of upbeat original progressive alternative rock and their own spin on clas
 sic hits from the 60s-90s \\(The Beatles\, The Doors\, Jimi Hendrix\, Pink
  Floyd\, Steely Dan\, The Police\, Men At Work\, U2\, Tears for Fears\, To
 m Petty\, Gerry Rafferty\, and more\\). \n\nWhether you like melodic voca
 ls\, searing guitar and sax solos\, intriguing lyrics\, or just great dyna
 mic and danceable rhythms\, The Social Contractors won't disappoint.\n\nTh
 e Social Contractors lineup for this free live performance features band f
 ounder and songwriter\, Jason E Davies \\(lead vocals\, lead/rhythm guitar
 \\)\, Travis Thayer \\(sax/keys/vocals\\)\, Rob Neidel \\(bass/vocals\\)\,
  Chris Oatman \\(drums\\).\n\nThe Lagunitas Tap Room is one of Petaluma's 
 finest brew pubs and outdoor music venues\, featuring an exquisite selecti
 on of fine craft beers on tap in addition to excellent alcohol-free bevera
 ges. Couple this with an array of enticing appetizers\, gourmet burgers\, 
 and salads\, positive socialization\, and general cheer in a festive setti
 ng with free live music means a "splendid time is guaranteed for all"
LOCATION:Lagunitas Brewing Company
URL:https://lagunitas.com/taproom/petaluma/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nature Hike at Lynch Canyon
