BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:H&L Live: Marshall House Project
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T153000
UID:260519AouSJVDs70-lrQOH48U3mg
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to H&L Live—our new concert series on the vineyard s
 tage! Join us Saturday\, May 23rd for an afternoon of live music\, wood-fi
 red pizza\, and wine country vibes as Marshall House Project lights up our
  outdoor venue.\n\n**Marshall House Project** is the North Bay's 2025 Bes
 t Funk Band\, and once you hear them\, you'll know why. Born on Marshall D
 rive in Santa Rosa\, this powerhouse ensemble blends blues\, rock\, funk\,
  reggae\, and soul into an original sound designed to keep you dancing. Wi
 th uplifting music full of twists and turns\, conscious lyrics\, and sizzl
 ing guitar solos\, Marshall House Project creates the kind of energy that 
 makes Friday afternoons unforgettable.\n\nThis is what our new stage was b
 uilt for: great artists\, beautiful afternoons\, and the Russian River Val
 ley as your backdrop. Bring a blanket\, grab a glass\, and settle in for o
 ne of those perfect wine country moments.\n\n**What to Know:**\n\n**Admiss
 ion is free** - just show up and enjoy\n\n**Pizza & Chill Red:** Fresh wo
 od-fired pizza paired with our new Chill Red\n\n**Outdoor seating** - Law
 n and picnic area available (bring blankets encouraged)\n\n**All ages welc
 ome** - Family-friendly event\n\n**Wine available** for purchase by the 
 glass or bottle\n\nThis is the first of our H&L Live series—a celebratio
 n of our outdoor stage\, our community\, and the artists who make wine cou
 ntry special. Come for the music\, stay for the pizza\, and remember why S
 aturdays in Sonoma County are the best.\n\n**Learn more about Marshall Hou
 se Project:** marshallhouseproject.com
LOCATION:Hook & Ladder Winery
URL:https://www.hookandladderwinery.com/event/hl-live-marshall-house-proje
 ct
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
