DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the arrival of spring with Mare Island Art Studios
 ’ annual Spring Show\, featuring a vibrant collection of work by our com
 munity of resident artists. This exhibit takes place in the Tim Rose Galle
 ry and highlights a range of mediums\, styles\, and personal expressions f
 rom our collective of over 20 artists. Each piece reflects a unique voice\
 , offering visitors an opportunity to experience the depth and diversity o
 f our creative community. Join us for the Opening Reception on Mother’s 
 Day\, May 10th from 12–4 PM\, and enjoy an inspiring afternoon surrounde
 d by art\, connection\, and celebration. Exhibit Hours: Open every Saturda
