DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T000000
UID:260224pbHRiOkS-kauUqWsGoA_hQ
DESCRIPTION:🌺 SambaDá at HopMonk Tavern Sebastopol\n\nSaturday\, May 2
 3 | Doors 7pm · Show 8pm | 21\\+ | $25\n\nLate spring\, good vibes\, and 
 a packed dance floor—SambaDá lights up HopMonk Sebastopol with their in
 fectious Brazilian sound.\n\nThis is feel-good music with deep roots: puls
 ing percussion\, soulful melodies\, and grooves that keep you moving from 
 the first note to the last. Whether you’re a longtime fan or brand new\,
  SambaDá’s live shows are all about connection\, joy\, and dancing toge
 ther.\n\nPerfect night out energy. Bring friends\, meet new ones\, and let
  the rhythm take over. 🌞🎶
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1037668755?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=2
 87&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
