 a Paz\, Tito Puente Jr\, Y muchos Más. \n\nDirector De Orquesta\,arreglis
 ta\,Y Compositor Wally El Timbalero ha sido Nombrado El Doble official De 
 Tito Puente/ La Reincarnation De Tito Puente. No Te Lo Puedes Perder! Tick
 ets Disponibles en la Puerta. \n\nEnglish: \n\nThe California Salsa Swing 
 Band is composed of only The Finest musicans in Marin County and the Bay A
 rea who have recorded and toured with musicans like Tito Puente sr\, Gabin
 o Pampini\, Celia Cruz\, Tony Vega\, Marc Anthony\, La India\, Rey Sepulve
 da\, Rey De La Paz\, Tito Puente Jr and many more. \n\nBandleader\, Arrang
 er\,and composer Wally El Timbalero has been named “Tito Puente Reborn/ 
 Tito Puente Reincarnation” by Top Musicians around the world and is dete
 rmined in reaching his goal in keeping Latino Culture alive while inspirin
 g the youth of today.
URL:https://latinbayarea.com/event/salsa-dura-by-california-salsa-swing-ba
 nd-calistoga/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
