UID:260520iDeAUm2pmECRswkO67LD6g
DESCRIPTION:Our annual Lavender Bloom Fest is May 23rd through July 12th! 
 We are open Saturdays and Sundays from 10 AM to 4 PM and Sunset Evenings\,
  Fridays May 29\, June 5\, 12\, 19 and 26th from 6 pm to 9 pm. Come see th
 e lavender in bloom and enjoy a lovely day surrounded by nature! Admission
  is $15 per person on most days and $20 per person on the days with the ja
 zz band \\(Sundays May 24\, June 21 and July 12th 10 am to 4 pm\, Jazz noo
 n to 3 pm\\). Kids 12 and under are free with an adult. Visit our website\
 , beesnblooms.com\, for more details and visit our online store\, found at
  shop.beesnblooms.com\, to purchase tickets. Nursery pick ups are on Wedne
 sdays through Fridays from 10 AM to 4 PM. The Nursery will also be open on
  Saturdays and Sundays during Lavender Bloom Fest. See you on the farm!
