UID:260519lr8W4AYAH02rWbiu8nbQVQ
DESCRIPTION:Heya folks! Tune and sit in with us in person Sunday May 24th 
 for MeshCore & Radio Comms 101 class from 1pm to 3pm @autonomous.gallery h
 ere in the V!\n\nThis training is a class for folks who are seeking knowle
 dge and skills of MeshCore: which is an open-source decentralized mesh net
 working platform designed for secure and off grid communication.\n\n\\_\\_
 \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\nFollowed up by an in-depth Radio Comm
 s 101 lesson about different types of radios\, licenses\, understanding of
  frequencies\, signals and range that will give attendees a better underst
 anding of how all that works\, and how relevant it can be when understandi
 ng MeshCore\n\n\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\nIf you 
