DESCRIPTION:“….Get ready for the super-entertaining sounds of local ba
 nd The Social Contractors. They totally rock\, in all the right ways…”
  - Argus-Courier\n\nJoin The Social Contractors from 5:30-8:30 PM on Sunda
 y\, 5/24 as they return to rock Murphy's Irish Pub with an evening of upbe
 at original progressive alternative rock and their own spin on classic hit
 s from the 60s-90s \\(The Beatles\, The Doors\, Jimi Hendrix\, Pink Floyd\
 , Steely Dan\, The Police\, Men At Work\, U2\, Tears for Fears\, Tom Petty
 \, Gerry Rafferty\, and more\\).\n\nWhether you like melodic vocals\, sear
 ing guitar and sax solos\, intriguing lyrics\, captivating songs\, or just
  great dynamic and danceable rhythms\, The Social Contractors won't disapp
 oint.\n\nThe Social Contractors lineup for this free live performance feat
 ures band founder and songwriter\, Jason E Davies \\(lead vocals\, lead/rh
 ythm guitar\\)\, Travis Thayer \\(sax/keys/vocals\\)\, Alex Fabian-Davies 
 \\(bass\\)\, and Chris Oatman \\(drums\\).\n\nLocated in the heart of hist
 oric downtown Sonoma\, Murphy's Irish Pub is the place to be for a lively 
 atmosphere of music\, social merriment\, and a diverse menu of delicious f
 ood\, and satisfying full bar beverage options.
LOCATION:Murphy's Irish Pub & Restaurant
URL:https://www.sonomapub.com/events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
