BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Stella Heath & Ian Scherer
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T143000
UID:2605196U0Qw6OtxEKwj3AINT3ylQ
DESCRIPTION:**Intimate Interplay: Stella Heath & Ian Scherer**\n\nJoin us 
 for No Cell Sundays with Stella Heath and Ian Scherer\, a duo whose decade
 -long musical partnership creates something truly extraordinary.\n\nHarken
 ing to the classic duo recordings of Ella Fitzgerald and Joe Pass\, their 
 sound is grounded in the art of interplay—where melody\, harmony\, and i
 mprovisation unfold in real time. With just voice and guitar\, they create
  a richly textured and intimate musical experience\, marked by sensitivity
 \, spontaneity\, and a shared musical language that can only come from yea
 rs of collaboration.\n\nTheir repertoire draws from the Great American Son
 gbook while also embracing more modern selections\, each reimagined throug
 h their distinct approach. Whether in a quiet listening room or on a conce
 rt stage\, Stella Heath and Ian Scherer invite audiences into a space of c
 onnection—where every phrase is shaped in the moment\, and each performa
 nce is uniquely alive.\n\n**What's No Cell Sundays?** It's simple: disconn
 ect from your devices\, reconnect with great wine\, live music\, and the p
 eople around you. *Check your phone with us at the door and receive a com
 plimentary tasting.* Bring a blanket\, grab a glass\, and spend your Sund
 ay the way it was meant to be spent.
LOCATION:Hook & Ladder Winery
URL:https://www.hookandladderwinery.com/event/no-cell-sundays-stella-ian
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
