BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:INTO THE LIGHT: Light-filled aintings by Katy Boggs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T170000
UID:2605015xp2rbkNPUu2iWhczqbYPQ
DESCRIPTION:Katy's paintings are an exploration of light—how it shapes f
 orm\, reveals color\, and defines what we see.\n\n"I am drawn to moments w
 here light is felt as much as seen: filtering through dense leaves\, tower
 ing in the crowns of trees\, glinting off cresting waves\, or softening in
 to the quiet glow of a sunset. Light is everywhere\; without it\, there is
  no seeing. Beyond its physical presence\, it also carries a deeper resona
 nce as a symbol of hope. In a time of uncertainty\, this work seeks to bri
 ng light into the image\, both visually and metaphorically."\n\nReception:
  April 25\, 4 to 6 pm.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Gallery
URL:http://sebastopolgallery.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Straight Tequila Night: ‘90s Country Tribute
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T000000
UID:260428BTIihHOlF0K95Dc2G0HQmg
DESCRIPTION:STRAIGHT TEQUILA NIGHT: '90S COUNTRY TRIBUTE\n\nStraight Tequi
 la Night is Texas's original '90s Country Tribute Band. From Garth Brooks 
 and George Strait\, to Tim McGraw and Brooks & Dunn\, to Shania Twain and 
 The Chicks\, they play all the songs you love from '90s Country radio\, an
 d some you forgot you love! Started "just for fun" in 2012 by a group of f
 riends and co-workers at Granada Theater in Dallas\, TX\, they went on to 
 be recognized as one of the best tribute bands in Texas. Featured in Vogue
 \, D Magazine\, The Dallas Observer\, The Knot\, and the hearts of tens of
  thousands of people all over Texas and beyond who've seen their show over
  the years. Though this was the first time these musicians all played toge
 ther\, there's about 100 years of combined professional music experience b
 etween them\, including 10+ years now together as Straight Tequila Night. 
 Known for their energetic and faithful renditions of these classic songs\,
  and their engaging and often humorous performances\, STN never fails to g
 et the boots scootin'!
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre & Music Hall
URL:https://wl.eventim.us/event/straight-tequila-night-90s-country-tribute
 /682216?afflky=MysticTheatre
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Slow Birding Journey
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T160000
UID:260425e70vej9dlUmghGxVDZad3A
DESCRIPTION:Do you enjoy a slow walk in a valley\, breezes\, wil
 dflowers\, the sounds of songbirds\, the taste of a Douglas Fir
  needle or a California Bay leaf\, the aroma of Tarweed\, or w
 atching wild turkeys and California Quail hunt for seeds and ins
 ects in the grass  Each month (weather permitting) we will explo
 re one or two of our three accessible trails-- the Creekside Tr
 ail\, the Nature Trail\, and the Meadow trail. Suitable for all
  levels and a range of mobility\, these Sunday afternoon adventu
 res will accommodate people using walkers or wheelchairs\, young 
 children\, parents with babies in strollers\, as well as those w
 ho just enjoy slow walks in nature that stimulate the five sens
 es. \n\nOur May outing will focus on the birds of Sugarloaf. Ti
 ckets are $5 for adults and free for children under 18 years o
 f age. All minors must be accompanied by parent or legal guardi
 an. **Tickets day-of\, on site will be $10 and might not be av
 ailable.** Meet at the White Barn parking lot. \n\nThere will be
  frequent stops and opportunities for conversation\, photography\,
  nature journaling\, wildlife viewing\, resting\, etc.\, so bring
  your nature journal\, camera\, or binoculars if you have them.
  Wear comfortable shoes\, a hat\, sun protection\, bring water a
 nd if desired\, a snack. Parking fees apply
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park
URL:https://sec.regfox.com/2026-mayjourn
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
