UID:260514gj7wHwKi6U6AjtwkGVNKgA
DESCRIPTION:Our weekly summer concerts in the Healdsburg Plaza from 6:00 p
 .m. to 8:00 p.m. provide an eclectic and unique line-up of bands\, and hav
 e been assembled to please a wide array of musical interests. Food vendors
  will be on-hand to offer locally sourced food for sale starting at 5:00 p
 .m. with the music beginning at 6:00 p.m.\n\nAbout the band: Enjoy the mu
 sic created by one of the most influential bands of our time. You'll hear 
 many of the Fab Four's #1 hits\, B sides and deep tracks - all performed w
 ith attention to detail duplicating their tight harmonies\, fancy guitar w
 ork and solid backbeat. In short\, that signature Beatles sound! \n\nBase
 d in Connecticut\, these 5 lads\, started out a few years back perfecting 
 their music and vocal harmonies as they grew a list of songs now nearing 1
 00! Performing at special events\, outdoor concerts\, libraries\, restaura
 nts and music festivals is the primary focus as their following grows with
  each performance. "No wigs\, costumes\, backing tracks or gimmicks here..
 .. just 5 guys who sing and play like The Beatles!"\n\nEnjoy some deliciou
 s cuisine from one of our Tuesdays in Plaza food vendors starting at 5:00 
 p.m.:\n\nTacos Don Tacos\n\nHealdsburger\n\nChef Degen\n\nLola's Market\n\
 nPacheco Roasted Corn\n\nTuesdays in the Plaza is hosted by the City of He
 aldsburg Community Services. A very special thank you to Big John's Marke
 t for their generous sponsorship.
LOCATION:Healdsburg Plaza 
URL:https://healdsburg.gov/335/Tuesdays-in-the-Plaza
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
