BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seeds of Change - Farm Dinner & Intern Showcase
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260527T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260527T193000
UID:260519dIWlaOh1bE2HQKi_Lw1BVA
DESCRIPTION:Seeds of Change - Farm Dinner & Intern Showcase Wednesday\, M
 ay 27 · 6–7:30pm · Fern Homestead\, Penngrove · $40/person\n\nJoin us
  for an evening on the farm with a Sonoma County–sourced dinner and the 
 chance to meet REA's incredible interns. Hear their stories\, walk the far
 m\, and connect with others who care about the future of food and farming 
 in our community.\n\nOn the menu: gourmet grilled cheese\, farm fresh sala
 d\, vegetable frittata\, strawberries & cream\, and nonalcoholic beverages
 . All sourced from local farms.\n\nGet your tickets at regenerativeeducati
 onalliance.org - limited seating so don't wait!\n\nSeeds of Change - Onli
 ne Auction Open Now! https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/seeds-of-chang
 e-online-auction\n\nOur online auction features a curated collection of lo
 cal experiences and goods donated by Sonoma County makers\, farms\, and bu
 sinesses - from a private tour of Fern Homestead to a farmhouse cheesemaki
 ng class to one-of-a-kind Petaluma gift baskets. Every bid goes directly t
 oward funding REA's programs in the coming year. \n\nBrowse and place you
 r bids here - More items will be added so check back frequently and start
  bidding today!\n\nWhether you join us around the table\, place a winning 
 bid\, or do both\, your support helps REA grow hands-on learning in agroec
 ology and nurture the next generation of environmental stewards right here
  at home. Thank you for being part of this.
LOCATION:Fern Homestead
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/seeds-of-change-farm-di
 nner-intern-showcase/18928518/2026-05-27T18
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
