 rooked Shoes takes the stage at Brewster’s Beer Garden!  Based right her
 e in Petaluma\, Crooked Shoes creates music that is "moody yet danceable"
 —a blend of potent hooks and brutal honesty. Their sound dives deep into
  themes of obsession and self-destruction\, turning the "better left unsai
 d" into unforgettable anthems that demand your full attention. This isn't 
 just background music\; it’s an experience for those who love the grit a
 nd soul of the North Bay's indie-rock scene.  Grab a cold brew\, find a sp
 ot in the garden\, and witness one of Petaluma’s most compelling alt-roc
 k acts live. THE DETAILS: Date: Sunday\, May 28th Time: 5:00 PM Location: 
