DESCRIPTION:The Wine and Dine with Saintsbury Winery \, a Sonoma Coast pio
 neer in Pinot Noir and Chardonnay since 1977. Founded by two Burgundy-insp
 ired enthusiasts\, Saintsbury has remained independent for over four decad
 es\, crafting site-specific wines with care and dedication. Guests will en
 joy five thoughtfully prepared courses paired with three wines\, including
  a rare pour from Sundawg Ridge Vineyard\, celebrating ten years of Saints
 bury's work on the Sonoma Coast. The menu features seared scallop tiradito
 \, roasted chicken thigh with gochujang glaze\, and Niman rack of lamb wit
 h pistachio crumble\, designed to complement each wine perfectly. Reservat
 ions essential for this intimate culinary and wine experience.
