BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Voces y Pasos: A Cultural Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T190000
UID:260225OVn28BeQEUy3qf2yHa7nQg
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the rich cultural traditions of Mexico through the v
 ibrant artistry of the musicians and dancers in LBC's afterschool Marichi 
 and Ballet Folklórico programs atVoces y Pasos \\(Voices and Steps\\): A 
 Cultural Celebration. Featuring more than 150 of Sonoma County's talented 
 youth\,Voces y Pasosbrings these traditions and celebrations to life in an
  unforgettable stage performance that pays tribute to their Mexican herita
 ge. LBC's Mariachi Ensemble and its sister program\, LBC's Ballet Folklór
 ico\, enroll students from all over the county. Together they deliver stun
 ning performances that blend technical skill\, stage presence\, and heartf
 elt expression while embodying the grace and vibrancy of traditional Mexic
 an folk music and dance. The young performers in these programs devote the
 mselves to weekly rehearsals and regular performances at community events 
 that continue to shape them into impressive artists. Thanks to the generos
 ity of our donors and sponsors\, they can participate at no cost to their 
 families\, with all equipment and costumes provided. Join us for an inspir
 ing evening that shines the spotlight on the voices and steps of these tal
 ented students and honors the enduring power of culture\, tradition\, and 
 community.
LOCATION:Datoire Foundation
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/voces-y-pasos-a-cultural-celebration/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Belly Dancing with Raja
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T183000
UID:2604204nZiMZ7HLUWOPw6AUQECgA
DESCRIPTION:Unlock your inner strength and find your flow. Belly dancing 
 with Raja is an innovative fusion class that blends the rhythmic artistry 
 of belly dance with the high-energy benefits of aerobics. Designed to b
 e both a cardiovascular challenge and a deep toning session\, this class f
 ocuses on the “powerhouse” of the body—your core.\n\nBy layering flu
 id\, isolative movements over an athletic aerobic base\, you will challeng
 e your muscles in ways traditional gym workouts can’t reach.\n\nWhat to 
 Expect\n\n• Core-Centric Power: Use undulations and shimmies to engage 
 deep abdominal muscles for a tighter\, stronger midsection.\n\n• Functio
 nal Stability: Improve your balance and posture through controlled\, hip-
 driven movements and low-impact aerobic footwork.\n\n• Total Body Toning
 : Build lean muscle in your legs\, glutes\, and arms while maintaining a 
 constant\, heart-pumping pace.\n\n• Mind-Body Connection: Enhance your 
 coordination and body awareness through rhythmic\, expressive choreography
 .\n\n“Whether you’re looking to define your waistline or simply want a
  workout that feels like a celebration\, this class offers the perfect bal
 ance of sweat and grace.”\n\nDifficulty Level: All levels welcome! No p
 rior dance experience is required—just bring your energy and a willingne
 ss to move.\n\nDATE AND TIME: Thursdays at 5:30 PM
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/belly-dancing-with-raja
 /18622402/2026-05-28T17
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
