BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Off the Perch + Sloan Irving
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260529T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260529T193000
UID:260510owlyp_jEN06JI69vExRgWw
DESCRIPTION:$15 General Admission\n\nDoors at 7:30pm. \n\nShow from 8:15-1
 0:30pm with one intermission\n\nEarlybirds!\n\n$3 off each ticket when you
  use the code earlybird18 at checkout. Offer ends May 24th.\n\nPromo C
 odes are not applicable at the door.\n\nCodes are not case sensitive\, b
 ut must be typed as one word.\n\nOff the Perch is a dynamic trio that ble
 nds contemporary song writing with the heartbeat of folk tradition. \n\nA
 t its core\, the group weaves acoustic instruments into rich\, living text
 ures that evolve into electric soundscapes\, evoking the California North 
 Bay’s vast expanse of forest\, field\, and sea.\n\nTheir music rises fro
 m the earth yet reaches for the unknown — rooted in craft\, lifted by lu
 sh harmonies\, and driven by original compositions offered by each member.
  \n\nWith every performance\, Off the Perch invites listeners into a spac
 e where time bends\, the duality of beauty and pain intertwine\, and where
  the shared pulse of the human experience becomes a transcendent celebrati
 on. \n\nSloan Irving is a 23 year old singer songwriter from Petaluma. S
 he pulls inspiration from many genres such as  americana\, soul\, and ind
 ie rock while leaning heavily into her love of simple but haunting folk me
 lodies and her desire to capture many sides of the human experience throug
 h her storytelling.\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/sloan.irving\n\nhttps://ww
 w.instagram.com/sloanirving\n\nhttps://youtube.com/channel/UCdoDaLRShGCwVO
 C8RIfTnTw\n\nhttps://open.spotify.com/artist/6Rd1Be5cGWYGDe6a5aeW8i
LOCATION:The Lost Church
URL:https://thelostchurch.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket#/instances/a0FUh0
 00007kxp3MAA
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
