DESCRIPTION:The Northern Still Dawn Angelosante's \\(piano\\) voice wraps 
 lyrics into a dreamscape of sound and story\, touching on love\, friendshi
 p\, heartbreak\, and self-reflection. Tony Gibson's \\(guitar\\) songwriti
 ng blends infectious melodies with honest\, emotionally resonant lyrics. H
 is music feels familiar and fresh. Michael Fecskes \\(cello\\)\, a classic
 ally trained cellist and composer\, adds a unique depth to the group's sou
 nd. His compositions are rich and soulful. Together\, they form The Northe
 rn Still\, a dynamic acoustic/folk-pop trio. Since 2021 they've combined t
 heir individual voices and musical influences into a lush\, intimate sound
 \, with haunting vocal harmonies. Whether performing original compositions
  or their fresh takes on covers\, they've captivated audiences throughout 
 the North Bay.   View this profile on Instagram     The Northern Still \\(
