DESCRIPTION:NGI's third annual fundraiser\, whose mission is to put a gard
 en in every home and help teach our communities about food sovereignty!\n\
 nCome groove with Neighborhood Garden Initiative at our third annual **Fo
 liage Funk Fest** fundraiser! This year\, we're getting funky at **Permac
 ulture Artisans** for a day filled with lush greenery\, amazing vendors\,
  fabulous vibes\, and hosted by two fabulous hosts\, **Lexie & Tiffany Ha
 yes**! Get ready to dance in the beautiful Sebestapol garden and enjoy liv
 e music from local artists. Whether you're a plant enthusiast or just look
 ing for a fun time\, this event is perfect for everyone. Don't miss out on
  this fusion of nature and music. All proceeds for the event will go to he
 lping NGI install **more gardens for our community**!
