 ting in this hands-on workshop while creating a small sculptural vessel. W
 orking with locally sourced wool\, you’ll explore how fiber transforms t
 hrough water\, soap\, and movement.\n\nIn this workshop you’ll:\n\n• L
 earn the fundamentals of wet felting\n\n• Understand how wool fibers bon
 d and shrink\n\n• Practice shaping wool into a three-dimensional form\n\
