 lora y fauna local\, y disfrutar de las vistas más espectaculares del val
 le.\n\nJoin us on an unforgettable adventure to the highest point of the p
 ark! This guided hike will take us through stunning landscapes\, from fore
 sts shaded by sequoias to trails surrounded by oaks\, culminating at the s
 ummit of Sonoma Mountain. \n\nIt's a perfect opportunity to connect with 
