SUMMARY:In the Sun that is Young Once Only - Vallejo Choral Society
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T150000
UID:260519bOTeWVHmc0iRr3QrmtPoqA
DESCRIPTION:An unforgettable evening of powerful choral music and reflecti
 on.\n\nThe program features John Corigliano’s Fern Hill\, a luminous and
  deeply moving choral setting of Dylan Thomas’s beloved poem exploring c
 hildhood wonder\, innocence\, and the passage of time.\n\nThe concert also
  marks the world premiere of Aux Arbres\, a new work by composer Christoph
 er Martin\, commissioned by the Vallejo Choral Society.\n\nArtistic Direct
 or Julia Morris conducts the VCS Symphonic and Chamber Choirs\, joined by 
 renowned pianist Paul Caccamo.\n\nAudiences will experience an evening of 
 beauty\, memory\, and musical storytelling as we close our season in song.
