BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Memory Lab
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260601T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260601T000000
UID:260513UFHk0ct9WEKlMpqd_BEw8A
DESCRIPTION:The Memory Lab is a free\, do-it-yourself space for making hig
 h-quality digitized personal archive collections. We have multiple appoint
 ment times and dates each week.
