DESCRIPTION:with Land \\+ Local\n\nExplore the art of crafting botanical s
 yrups and shrubs in this hands-on workshop with Land \\+ Local. Using seas
 onal fruits\, herbs\, and medicinal plants\, you’ll create flavorful mix
 ers for your home bar.\n\nIn this workshop you’ll:\n\n• Learn the basi
 cs of shrubs and botanical syrups\n\n• Explore herbs\, fruits\, and plan
 ts for flavor and function\n\n• Taste and experiment with seasonal ingre
 dients\n\n• Create one custom shrub and one botanical mixer\n\nYou’ll
  leave with two non-alcoholic mixers and recipes to continue at home. Li
 ght snacks provided. No experience required.
