DESCRIPTION:Join us as we celebrate Kendra Scott’s Grand Opening weekend
 . On Friday\, June 5th from 3-5pm\, enjoy live music and Kendra Scott Summ
 er Collection inspired mocktails and sweets while you browse their new loc
