DESCRIPTION:Get out the flannels and dust off your Docs! Midlife Riot is a
  San Rafael\, California based 4-piece bringing you all the anthems of 90s
  alternative rock.\n\nFeaturing seasoned musicians from the Bay Area scene
 \, the band delivers a high-energy show packed with the hits that defined 
