SUMMARY:Longboard Vineyards Wine\, Dine & Dance
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260605T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260605T190000
UID:251222ioHTBMgFrU-HCZhVrAMA-Q
DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Music\, Wine & Dine at Longboard Vineyards\n\n**F
 eaturing Used Goods & Casa Nostra Wood-Fired Pizza**\n\nJoin us for a rela
 xed and lively Friday night at Longboard Vineyards in our Barrel Room\, lo
 cated in downtown Healdsburg\, featuring live music\, award-winning wine\,
  and handcrafted food. Our Music\, Wine & Dine Night pairs the feel-good\,
  crowd-friendly sounds of Used Goods with delicious wood-fired pizzas from
  Casa Nostra.\n\nUsed Goods brings an upbeat mix of familiar favorites and
  easygoing grooves\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a social evening 
 surrounded by barrels and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboard’s wines 
 by the glass or bottle while Casa Nostra serves their signature wood-fired
  pizzas\, made fresh on site with quality ingredients.\n\nFriday | 5:00 PM
  – 7:00 PM Free entry\n\nPlease note: This is an over-21 event inside th
 e Barrel Room. Under-21 guests and leashed pets are welcome on the patio o
 nly.\n\nCome grab a seat early and enjoy a classic Sonoma County night of 
 great music\, great wine\, and great food.\n\nWine available for purchase 
 Live music by Used Goods Food by Casa Nostra Wood-Fired Pizza Location: Lo
 ngboard Vineyards Barrel Room Address: 5 Fitch Street\, Healdsburg\, CA 95
 448
LOCATION:Longboard Vineyards
URL:https://www.longboardvineyards.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
