BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:HEAT FOR HEROES CHILI COOK OFF
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T160000
UID:2605208qCodOkWREKlpas1yBSZgA
DESCRIPTION:“HEAT FOR HEROS” Chili Cook Off fundraiser set to spice up
  support for local first responders.\n\nMC and Chili Judge Heather Holmes\
 , KTVU Anchor will be ready to turn up the heat for a good cause at the up
 coming “HEAT FOR HEROS” Chili Cook Off Fundraiser\, a down-home cook o
 ff between local first responders and other community competitors who will
  compete for bragging rights while raising funds to support Strengthen You
 r Mind Initiative who support our men and women in uniform.\n\nThe event w
 ill take place on Saturday\, June 6th from noon to 4 p.m.at Imagery Estate
  Winery in honor of Bob Benziger\, bringing together chili lovers of all a
 ges for an afternoon of bold flavors\, friendly competition and community 
 spirit.  Attendees’ will have the opportunity to sample a variety of ch
 ilis and vote for their favorites while enjoying the “big beats for big 
 moments” by DJ B Huge.\n\nProceeds from the event with enable Strengthen
  Your Mind Initiative to provide resiliency/mindfulness retreats for our l
 ocal first responders. Strengthen Your Mind Initiative is dedicated to sup
 porting the mental health and resilience of first responders. Through mind
 fulness training\, wellness programs\, and restorative retreats\, the orga
 nization provides critical tools to help those who serve our communities m
 anage stress\, process trauma\, and build long-term emotional strength.
LOCATION:Imagery Estate Winery
URL:http://strengthenyourmindinitiative.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
