DESCRIPTION:Join us at Fulton Crossing for the opening of Robert Ochs new 
 show\, FROM FIGURE TO LANDSCAPE\, exploring the space between representati
 on and abstraction.\n\nThis collection moves fluidly between figure and la
 ndscape\, focusing on the essential elements of painting—shape\, line\, 
 color\, texture\, and form—inviting viewers to find their own interpreta
 tion within the work.\n\nSaturday\, June 6th\, 2026 1:00 – 4:00 PM\n\nLi
 ve guitarist\, open studios\, and refreshments\n\nSee less
LOCATION:Fulton Crossing
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/996277682798270/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
