BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Sidemen Live at Buena Vista Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T210000
UID:2604126mHmK-zDiEqAd-53UR3FFw
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable evening of world‑class jazz as 
 **The Sidemen** bring their powerhouse sound to the historic **Buena Vista
  Winery**. Surrounded by Sonoma’s oldest vines and timeless charm\, this
  concert pairs the region’s finest wines with the deep swing and soulful
  energy of a seven‑piece jazz ensemble at the top of their game.\n\nWith
  three horns out front and a rhythm section built for lift‑off\, The Sid
 emen deliver a sound that’s tight\, expressive\, and steeped in the jazz
  tradition.\n\n**The Music**\n\nExpect a night of **straight‑ahead jazz*
 *\, featuring **original three‑horn arrangements** crafted by the band. 
 Their set draws from the iconic works of: **Charles Mingus\, John Coltrane
 \, Wayne Shorter\, Cannonball Adderley** …and other masters who shaped t
 he language of modern jazz.\n\nThese arrangements honor the spirit of the 
 originals while giving each musician room to stretch\, converse\, and igni
 te the stage.\n\n**Why This Night Will Stand Out**\n\nA rare chance to hea
 r **three‑horn arrangements** performed by some of the region’s most r
 espected improvisers\n\nA setting that blends **historic Sonoma elegance**
  with the spontaneity of live jazz\n\nA perfect pairing of **wine\, atmosp
 here\, and musicianship**\n\n**Enjoy Dinner With TriTip Trolley!**\n\nSett
 le in with a glass of Buena Vista’s finest and let The Sidemen take you 
 on a journey through the heart of the jazz tradition. **June 6 is going to
  swing.**
LOCATION:Buena Vista Historical Winery
URL:https://www.sonomavalleyjazzsociety.org/jazz-at-buena-vista-winery
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
