BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Vallejo Pista Sa Nayon
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T180000
UID:2603257QTbMyrRh0ariq7ObFqGvQ
DESCRIPTION:Vallejo Pista Sa Nayon \\(“Town Festival”\\) is Vallejo’
 s largest annual Filipino cultural celebration\, honoring Philippine Indep
 endence Day through food\, music\, dance\, and cultural performances that 
 showcase the richness and diversity of the islands. 2026 marks our 40th an
 niversary of Vallejo Pista Sa Nayon.\n\nJoin thousands in celebrating heri
 tage\, community\, and unity—a vibrant gathering rooted in tradition and
  shared pride.\n\nJoin us for a one-of-a-kind festival!  Attendees will l
 earn about the islands and experience a deeper dive into their history\, t
 raditions\, history\, food\, language\, and more.  Our festival hopes to 
 inspire and strengthen families and the larger community.\n\n\\_\\_\\_\\_\
 \_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_
 \n\nParking is limited. We highly encourage early arrival\, carpooling and
  taking the free SF Bay Ferry between downtown Vallejo and Mare Island.
LOCATION:Mare Island Waterfront Promenade
URL:https://www.vallejopistasanayon.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
