BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Bar(n) Crawl at Charlie's Acres
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T160000
UID:2605117RsX9GWwRkWRfBDUFAeULg
DESCRIPTION:One of Charlie's Acres' signature events returns with a unique
  21\\+ experience blending wine\, food\, and animal encounters. Guests wil
 l stroll the sanctuary loop\, meeting rescued farm animals\, hearing their
  stories\, and even joining in fun moments like a watermelon smash. Enjoy 
 wine tastings from Etude Winery and Tomorrow Cellars \\(including non-alco
 holic options\\)\, along with a plant-based BBQ picnic lunch by Nova Terra
  Kitchen & Creamery. This memorable event offers a chance to connect with 
 animals\, savor great food and wine\, and support a meaningful cause. Proc
 eeds benefit the care of rescued animals and free humane education program
 s. Timed entry ensures a relaxed\, enjoyable experience for all.
