 eting \\+ exposure: your art and information is featured in a professional
 ly designed catalog distributed across the Bay Area\, on social media\, em
 ail newsletters\, road signs and on our website with an interactive map. A
 ccess to special event demonstration opportunities \\(e.g. farmers markets
 \, fairs\\). Support for artists at every level\, including a dedicated\, 
 year-round Program Manager Access to artist resources\, marketing \\+ deve
 lopment workshops\, and professional analytics Opportunities to participat
 e in professional Preview Exhibitions Gallery-quality reception and exposu
