DESCRIPTION:Live music 11 am – 1 pm\n\nWelcome your Sunday at Priest Ran
 ch! Sunday Sessions features live acoustic music\, brunch-themed small bit
 es from The Kitchen at Priest Ranch\, and a curated flight of brunch-frien
